    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present No. 613 Virginia Heights to the market, an excellent four-bedroom semi-detached family home ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac within this highly sought-after and established residential development in Dublin 24. Extending to approximately 100 sq.m., this superb property has been exceptionally well maintained and benefits from a comprehensive range of upgrades throughout.\n\nThe property is presented in excellent condition, having been freshly painted with new carpet fitted throughout. The accommodation comprises an extended entrance hallway, a bright and welcoming living room with gas fire, a converted garage space currently used as a fourth bedroom, and a generous kitchen/dining area. The kitchen has been re-plastered and benefits from French doors providing access to the rear garden. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom.\n\nThe property has undergone a number of significant improvements, including a full rewire, PVC double-glazed windows, a Baxi gas combi boiler, smooth-plastered ceilings throughout, and a house alarm. The staircase has been upgraded with a stylish beech and metal finish. The attic is fully insulated and benefits from flooring throughout and lighting, providing excellent additional storage space. Further upgrades include a replacement sealed PVC water tank, new gutters, an electric shower and the replacement of the rear back door with a window.\n\nExternally, the property enjoys a beautiful sunny green area directly to the front, creating an attractive open outlook. There are two private car parking spaces to the front, while the rear boasts a spacious lawned garden, providing an ideal setting for outdoor entertaining and family use.\n\nThe location is excellent, with The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght Hospital and the LUAS all within walking distance. A wide selection of schools, shops, pubs, restaurants and recreational amenities are also close by. The property also enjoys easy access to the N7, N81 and M50, making it ideal for commuters.\n\nNo. 613 Virginia Heights offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious and well-maintained four-bedroom family home in a peaceful yet highly convenient location. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate this fine property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nSee 3D Tour - \nhttps://my.matterport.com/show/?m=UK6XRcKFSZg\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 4-bedroom semi-detached family home</li><li> Approx. 111 sq.m. / 1,200 sq.ft.</li><li> Quiet cul-de-sac location</li><li> Fully rewired throughout</li><li> PVC double-glazed windows & Baxi gas combi boiler</li><li> Freshly painted with new carpet throughout</li><li> Fully insulated & floored attic with lighting</li><li> Converted garage providing fourth bedroom</li><li> Two private car parking spaces</li><li> Excellent Dublin 24 location close to LUAS, The Square & Tallaght Hospital</ul>"
